1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
(Leonard:)But just for fun... why?

2
00:00:03,168 --> 00:00:05,838
(Penny:)Not in a rush, busy with work...

3
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:08,309
(Penny:)Things are good
right now.
Really good.

4
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,075
(Leonard:)You still want
to get married, right?

5
00:00:11,077 --> 00:00:13,377
(Penny:)Oh, my God. Yes.
Why would you even ask that?

6
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,180
(Raj:)I don't know.
Because we don't have a date?

7
00:00:15,181 --> 00:00:17,451
(Penny:)Well, you want a date,
pick a date.

8
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:18,720
(Leonard:)It's not just the date.

9
00:00:18,718 --> 00:00:20,148
(Leonard:)We haven't talked
about anything.

10
00:00:20,153 --> 00:00:22,023
(Leonard:)Big wedding, small wedding,
indoor, outdoor...

11
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:27,222
(Sheldon:)Outdoor? Oh.
I can RSVP no right now.

12
00:00:27,227 --> 00:00:29,457
(Penny:)Okay, indoor it is.
Big or small?

13
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:31,192
(Leonard:)Is your dad paying for it?
I doubt it.

14
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:33,797
(Leonard:)Okay, two friends each.

15
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,600
(Penny:)All right, well,
I want it in a church.

16
00:00:36,603 --> 00:00:37,933
(Leonard:)Fine. I want black-tie.

17
00:00:37,938 --> 00:00:39,938
(Leonard:)Fine.
I want to release butterflies.

18
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:42,310
(Sheldon:)Seriously? Airborne worms?

19
00:00:43,776 --> 00:00:45,776
Okay. Well, then it's settled:

20
00:00:45,779 --> 00:00:48,479
(Leonard:)small indoor church wedding,
black-tie, no butterflies.

21
00:00:48,481 --> 00:00:49,751
(Penny:)Sounds perfect.
Great.

22
00:00:52,084 --> 00:00:53,414
(Leonard:)You still
didn't pick a date.

23
00:00:53,420 --> 00:01:00,020
Stay out of it!
Shut up!

